+  once: 11, doce: 12, trece: 13, catorce: 14, quince: 15, dieciseis: 16, diecisiete: 17, dieciocho: 18,
+  diecinueve: 19, veinte: 20, veinticinco: 25, treinta: 30, cuarenta: 40, cincuenta: 50, sesenta: 60,
